msgid "Switch 2 Blocker"
msgstr "Switch 2 联网伪装"

msgid "Nintendo Switch 2: Connection Spoofing and Update Blocking"
msgstr "Nintendo Switch 2 联网伪装与系统更新阻断"

msgid "Separate dnsmasq and uHTTPd instances mimic the Nintendo test response. Switch 2 and Switch 1 can pass the connection test without internet access."
msgstr "通过独立 dnsmasq 实例与 uHTTPd 伪装响应，使 Switch 2 / Switch 1 在完全断绝外网更新的情况下通过局域网连接测试。"

msgid "Note:"
msgstr "提示："

msgid "If you use a proxy plugin (SSR Plus+, PassWall, or OpenClash), add the Nintendo Connection Test Domain and Switch Helper IP to its bypass list."
msgstr "若路由器启用了 SSR Plus+ / PassWall / OpenClash 等代理插件，请务必将「任天堂联网测试域名」及「Switch 专用伪装辅助 IP」加入不走代理的白名单，防止流量被代理插件劫持。"

msgid "Network Isolation"
msgstr "基础网络隔离设置"

msgid "Current Firewall"
msgstr "当前固件防火墙架构"

msgid "fw3 (iptables) uses /etc/firewall.user"
msgstr "fw3 (iptables) - 自动使用 /etc/firewall.user"

msgid "Enable Spoofing and Update Blocking"
msgstr "启用伪装与断网保护"

msgid "This sets up the helper interface, separates the dnsmasq and uHTTPd listeners, and adds firewall rules. Turning it off restores the original network settings."
msgstr "开启后将自动配置辅助接口、分离 dnsmasq/uHTTPd 监听并注入防火墙阻断规则；关闭后自动无损还原默认网络配置。"

msgid "Force DHCP"
msgstr "开启强制 DHCP"

msgid "Use this on a secondary router. It sets dhcp.lan.force=1 so main_dns handles LAN DHCP. This keeps the main router from giving the Switch the wrong DNS server."
msgstr "旁路由模式推荐开启。强制由本路由器的 main_dns 接管局域网 DHCP 分配（即设置 dhcp.lan.force=1），防止主路由抢先回应导致 Switch 2 获取到错误的 DNS。"

msgid "fw4 Firewall Rule Mode"
msgstr "fw4 防火墙规则写入方式"

msgid "Use the native directory on OpenWrt 22.03 or later. On custom builds such as LEDE, use the custom rules file."
msgstr "官方原版 OpenWrt 22.03+ 推荐选择「原生规则目录」；LEDE 等带自定义规则页面的定制固件推荐选择「自定义规则文件」。"

msgid "Native directory: /etc/nftables.d/ (OpenWrt)"
msgstr "写入 /etc/nftables.d/ 原生规则目录（官方原版通用）"

msgid "Custom rules file: /etc/firewall.user (LEDE)"
msgstr "写入 /etc/firewall.user 自定义规则文件（LEDE 固件默认推荐）"

msgid "Router LAN IP"
msgstr "路由器主 LAN IP"

msgid "The main dnsmasq and LuCI use this IP. The app detects it from the LAN interface."
msgstr "主 dnsmasq 与后台管理界面监听的 IP 地址（自动探测当前 LAN 口 IP）。"

msgid "Switch Helper IP"
msgstr "Switch 专用伪装辅助 IP"

msgid "A separate IP on br-lan. Use a different address in the same subnet as the Router LAN IP."
msgstr "在 br-lan 上创建的独立虚拟接口 IP，必须与主 LAN IP 在同一网段且不能相同。"

msgid "The Switch Helper IP must differ from the Router LAN IP."
msgstr "伪装辅助 IP 不能与路由器主 LAN IP 相同！"

msgid "Use a Switch Helper IP in the same /24 subnet as the Router LAN IP, such as %s.254."
msgstr "伪装辅助 IP 必须与主 LAN IP 处于同一 /24 网段（如 %s.254）！"

msgid "Nintendo Connection Test Domain"
msgstr "任天堂联网测试域名"

msgid "Default: ctest.p01.ctest.srv.nintendo.net. Usually no change is needed."
msgstr "默认拦截 ctest.p01.ctest.srv.nintendo.net，通常无需修改。"

msgid "Connection Self-Test"
msgstr "服务连通性自检"

msgid "Click Save & Apply first. The self-test checks the DNS redirect, the 2-byte HTTP response, port 80, and the firewall rules."
msgstr "保存并应用后，点击此按钮调用 test.sh 验证 DNS 解析、HTTP 2 字节响应、80 端口占用及防火墙状态。"

msgid "Run Self-Test"
msgstr "立即测试伪装服务"

msgid "Controlled Devices"
msgstr "受控主机列表 (MAC 精准下发与防火墙兜底)"

msgid "If a listed device uses Automatic (DHCP), it gets the Switch Helper IP as its DNS server. You can also block its internet access."
msgstr "列出的设备在 Wi-Fi 设置为「自动获取 (DHCP)」时，将自动分配专属伪装 DNS，并可选通过防火墙彻底封禁外网访问。"

msgid "Device Name"
msgstr "设备备注"

msgid "MAC Address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "Static IP (Optional)"
msgstr "分配静态 IP (可选)"

msgid "Leave blank for an automatic IP. The device still gets the Switch Helper IP as its DNS server."
msgstr "留空则由路由器自动分配动态 IP，并同样下发专属伪装 DNS。"

msgid "Auto-assign (e.g., %s.x)"
msgstr "留空自动分配 (如 %s.x)"

msgid "Auto-assign"
msgstr "留空自动分配"

msgid "The static IP must differ from the Router LAN IP and the Switch Helper IP."
msgstr "静态 IP 不能与路由器主 IP 或伪装辅助 IP 相同！"

msgid "Use a static IP in the same subnet as the Router LAN IP (%s.x)."
msgstr "静态 IP 必须与路由器主 LAN IP 处于同一网段（%s.x）！"

msgid "Block Internet Access"
msgstr "防火墙彻底断外网"

msgid "The firewall uses the MAC address to block ICMPv6 and all IPv4 and IPv6 forwarding. This stops updates that use hard-coded IP addresses."
msgstr "注入防火墙规则拦截该 MAC 的 IPv6 ICMPv6 寻址及所有 IPv4/IPv6 外网转发流量，防止后台硬编码 IP 偷跑更新。"

msgid "Spoofing and update blocking are off. Enable them, then click Save & Apply."
msgstr "当前未启用「启用伪装与断网保护」，请先勾选并点击「保存并应用」后再执行自检。"

msgid "This page or the device list has unsaved changes. Click Save & Apply before running the self-test."
msgstr "检测到当前页面参数或受控设备列表已修改但尚未生效，请先点击底部的「保存并应用」后再进行自检！"

msgid "Enter a Switch Helper IP, then click Save & Apply."
msgstr "伪装辅助 IP 为空，请先填写并点击「保存并应用」。"

msgid "Running the Self-Test..."
msgstr "正在执行连通性伪装自检..."

msgid "Checking the DNS redirect, the 2-byte uHTTPd response, port 80, and the firewall rules."
msgstr "正在调用 test.sh 验证 DNS 劫持、uHTTPd 2 字节响应、80 端口占用及防火墙规则..."

msgid "Resolved to %s."
msgstr "正常 (已解析至 %s)"

msgid "DNS did not return the Switch Helper IP. Check for a global DNS redirect or a proxy intercepting requests."
msgstr "异常 (未命中目标 IP，请检查全局 DNS 重定向或代理劫持)"

msgid "Returned 200 OK with the 2-byte body \"ok\"."
msgstr "正常 (返回 200 OK 且正文精确为 2 字节 \"ok\")"

msgid "Unexpected HTTP status or body length. Bytes: %s."
msgstr "异常 (响应状态或正文字节不符，当前字节数: %s)"

msgid "[Body: \"%s\" | Bytes: %s]"
msgstr "[正文: \"%s\" | 字节数: %s]"

msgid "Nothing is listening on %s:80. The uHTTPd helper is not running."
msgstr "异常：未检测到 %s:80 的监听进程 (uHTTPd 辅助实例未启动)"

msgid "Only uHTTPd is listening on %s:80."
msgstr "正常 (已由 uHTTPd 独占监听 %s:80，无端口冲突)"

msgid "Other web service"
msgstr "其他 Web 服务"

msgid "\"%s\" uses port 80 on all addresses. Set it to listen only on the Router LAN IP (%s:80)."
msgstr "冲突：80 端口被「%s」全局占用！请将其改为仅监听主 LAN IP (%s:80)"

msgid "Skipped. No device has internet blocking enabled."
msgstr "已跳过 (受控列表未启用断外网设备)"

msgid "Saved to %s. Active rules in the firewall: %d."
msgstr "已写入 %s 且内核防火墙已实时生效 (共 %d 条规则)"

msgid "Rules are in %s, but the firewall did not load them. Change the firewall rule mode, then click Save & Apply."
msgstr "规则已写入 %s，但内核防火墙未加载！建议切换规则写入方式后重新保存"

msgid "No blocking rules in %s. Make sure that you clicked Save & Apply."
msgstr "未在 %s 检测到阻断规则 (请确认已点击「保存并应用」)"

msgid "Self-Test Results"
msgstr "自检结果"

msgid "1. DNS redirect:"
msgstr "1. DNS 劫持状态："

msgid "2. HTTP response:"
msgstr "2. HTTP 伪装状态："

msgid "3. Port 80:"
msgstr "3. 80 端口占用检查："

msgid "4. Firewall rules:"
msgstr "4. 防火墙阻断规则状态："

msgid "No output"
msgstr "无输出"

msgid "No listeners on port 80."
msgstr "未检测到相关 80 端口监听记录"

msgid "No active Switch 2 blocking rules in the firewall."
msgstr "内核防火墙中暂无生效的 Switch 2 阻断规则"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Could not run the self-test: %s"
msgstr "检测执行失败: %s"
